   "html": "<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Étape 1 sur 3</div>\n<h2 id=\"tm-etape1\">Ce que vous savez faire, ou ce qui vous tient à cœur</h2>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" data-tm-reset=\"\" type=\"button\">Tout effacer</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"prose-note\">Cochez autant de cases que vous voulez. Un métier, une formation, une expérience de terrain ou simplement un sujet qui vous importe : tout compte. <span data-tm-count=\"\">Aucune case cochée</span>.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"Compétences et centres d’intérêt\" class=\"tm-chips\" role=\"group\">\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"agri\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Agriculture, élevage</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"envi\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Environnement, eau, énergie</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"sante\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Santé, prévention</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"educ\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Éducation, jeunesse, formation</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"droit\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Droit, justice, administration</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"femmes\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Femmes, égalité</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"social\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Action sociale, handicap, entraide</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"histoire\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Histoire, mémoire, patrimoine</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"langue\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Langue bedjond, culture, arts</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"recherche\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Recherche, université</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"num\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Informatique, numérique, données</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"comm\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Communication, rédaction, médias</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"finance\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Finance, gestion, entrepreneuriat</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"urba\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Urbanisme, routes, transport, BTP</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"gouv\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Relations institutionnelles, plaidoyer</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"paix\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Médiation, dialogue, cohésion</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"tm-chip\" data-k=\"diaspora\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi tm-check\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7\"></path></svg>Diaspora, réseaux, mise en relation</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tm-grid2\">\n<fieldset class=\"tm-field\">\n<legend>Étape 2 sur 3</legend>\n<p class=\"tm-field-titre\">Où êtes-vous ?</p>\n<div class=\"tm-radios\">\n<label class=\"tm-radio\"><input name=\"tm-lieu\" type=\"radio\" value=\"terrain\"/><span>À Bédjondo ou dans le Mandoul</span></label>\n<label class=\"tm-radio\"><input name=\"tm-lieu\" type=\"radio\" value=\"tchad\"/><span>Ailleurs au Tchad</span></label>\n<label class=\"tm-radio\"><input name=\"tm-lieu\" type=\"radio\" value=\"diaspora\"/><span>Dans la diaspora</span></label>\n</div>\n<p class=\"tm-note\">Certaines thématiques se jouent sur place, d’autres se portent très bien à distance.</p>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset class=\"tm-field\">\n<legend>Étape 3 sur 3</legend>\n<p class=\"tm-field-titre\">Combien de temps pouvez-vous donner ?</p>\n<div class=\"tm-radios\">\n<label class=\"tm-radio\"><input name=\"tm-temps\" type=\"radio\" value=\"peu\"/><span>Quelques heures par mois</span></label>\n<label class=\"tm-radio\"><input name=\"tm-temps\" type=\"radio\" value=\"moyen\"/><span>Une demi-journée par semaine</span></label>\n<label class=\"tm-radio\"><input name=\"tm-temps\" type=\"radio\" value=\"plus\"/><span>Davantage</span></label>\n</div>\n<p class=\"tm-note\">Coordonner une thématique demande de la régularité ; contribuer ponctuellement est déjà précieux.</p>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<p class=\"tm-go\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-tm-go=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fi fi--btn\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m6 13 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg>Voir nos propositions</button></p>"
